<title>JAPAN: Alps Elec develops tuner for digital broadcasting.</title>
<headline>Alps Elec develops tuner for digital broadcasting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alps Electric Co Ltd said on Tuesday it has developed a tuner for ground-based digital broadcasting.</p>
<p>The device, which was jointly developed with a unit of News Corp Ltd and Motorola Inc, will be installed in set-top boxes to receive digitally broadcast television programmes, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The device will be first be shipped in Britain, where ground-based digital broadcasting is schedule to begin in July 1998. The company will start mass-producing the device next January, the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
